    "The server's host key has changed. Saved: %@ %@. Offered: %@ %@. If the server was reinstalled or its keys were replaced, forget its host key and connect again. If not, something may be intercepting the connection." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The server's host key has changed. Saved: %1$@ %2$@. Offered: %3$@ %4$@. If the server was reinstalled or its keys were replaced, forget its host key and connect again. If not, something may be intercepting the connection."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "服务器的主机密钥已更改。已存储：%@ %@。出示：%@ %@。如果服务器已重装或其密钥已更换，请忘记其主机密钥后重新连接。否则，可能有东西正在拦截连接。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "伺服器的主機金鑰已更改。已儲存：%@ %@。出示：%@ %@。如果伺服器已重灌或其金鑰已更換，請忘記其主機金鑰後重新連線。否則，可能有東西正在攔截連線。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "サーバのホスト鍵が変更されました。保存済み: %1$@ %2$@。提示: %3$@ %4$@。サーバが再インストールされたか鍵が交換された場合は、ホスト鍵を消去して再接続してください。そうでない場合、接続が傍受されている可能性があります。"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La clé d’hôte du serveur a changé. Enregistrée : %1$@ %2$@. Présentée : %3$@ %4$@. Si le serveur a été réinstallé ou ses clés remplacées, oubliez sa clé d’hôte et reconnectez-vous. Sinon, quelque chose intercepte peut-être la connexion."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La clave de host del servidor ha cambiado. Guardada: %1$@ %2$@. Presentada: %3$@ %4$@. Si el servidor se ha reinstalado o se han reemplazado sus claves, olvida su clave de host y vuelve a conectarte. Si no, algo podría estar interceptando la conexión."
          }
        }
      }
    },
